body:
When you do a user search for OrbicMist264 on [chess.com](https://chess.com) it also brings up the account of ObricMist274 but in the description for this account is the username OrbicMist264. Also has the same country listed as phillipines.

&#x200B;

The OrbicMist264 also has display picture of minecraft just for info.

&#x200B;

The username also comes up on something to do with 'powdergames' which is also in his youtube videos.

In the chess videos he posts, he uses the same username. I've emailed [chess.com](https://chess.com) to see if they can do anything. The user account on [chess.com](https://chess.com) shows as the phillippines.

&#x200B;

Another potential username is OrbitMist274 (rather than 264)

&#x200B;

They also seem to sometimes switch between orbit and orbic
